        <notes>
            <note>I have found no advertisements offering the book by subscription. Hoyle registered
                the work at Stationers' Hall on 1751-01-18, but the imprint and February
                advertisement show that Jolliffe had purchased the copyright. An advertisement for
                the Dublin </note>
            <note url="brag.d.1.xml">reprint</note>
            <note> indicates that the price of the London edition was half a guinea. For further
